{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "The sum of two consecutive odd integers is 32."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Let the smaller be n, then the larger is n + 2."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "n + (n + 2) = 32."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "2n + 2 = 32, so 2n = 30, n = 15."}], "answer": "15"}
