{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "The perimeter of the square is 36 meters."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "A square's perimeter equals 4 times its side length."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "The side length is 36 \u00f7 4 = 9 meters."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "The area of a square is side \u00d7 side = 9 \u00d7 9 = 81 square meters."}], "answer": "81"}
