{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "The base is 10 inches and the height is 6 inches."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Area of a triangle = (base \u00d7 height) \u00f7 2."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Base \u00d7 height = 10 \u00d7 6 = 60."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "Area = 60 \u00f7 2 = 30 square inches."}], "answer": "30"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "The radius is 7 feet."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Circumference of a circle = 2 \u00d7 \u03c0 \u00d7 radius."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "2 \u00d7 (22/7) \u00d7 7 = 2 \u00d7 22 = 44."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "The circumference is 44 feet."}], "answer": "44"}
