{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "The bases are 6 cm and 10 cm, and the height is 4 cm."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Area of a trapezoid = (base1 + base2) \u00d7 height \u00f7 2."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Sum of bases = 6 + 10 = 16 cm."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "Area = 16 \u00d7 4 \u00f7 2 = 64 \u00f7 2 = 32 square centimeters."}], "answer": "32"}
