{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "Principal is $1,000."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Annual rate is 5%, compounded quarterly, so quarterly rate = 0.05/4 = 0.0125."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Number of quarters in 3 years = 3 \u00d7 4 = 12."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [1, 2, 3], "text": "Balance = 1000 \u00d7 (1 + 0.0125)^12 = 1000 \u00d7 (1.0125)^12 \u2248 1160.75."}], "answer": "1160.75"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "Principal is $2,000."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Annual rate 4%, monthly rate = 0.04/12 = 0.003333\u2026, number of months = 2\u00d712 = 24."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Balance = 2000 \u00d7 (1 + 0.003333\u2026)^24."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "Balance \u2248 2000 \u00d7 1.083142 = 2166.28, so interest = 2166.28 \u2212 2000 = 166.28."}], "answer": "166.28"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "Principal = $3,500, target = $4,500."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Annual rate = 6%, so multiplier per year = 1.06."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Need 3500 \u00d7 (1.06)^n > 4500, so (1.06)^n > 4500/3500 = 1.285714."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "n = ln(1.285714)/ln(1.06) \u2248 0.2513/0.05827 \u2248 4.31, so smallest whole year is 5."}], "answer": "5"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "Principal = $750."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Annual 8%, semiannual rate = 0.08/2 = 0.04, number of half-years = 5\u00d72 = 10."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Balance = 750 \u00d7 (1.04)^10."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "(1.04)^10 \u2248 1.480244, so balance \u2248 750 \u00d7 1.480244 = 1110.183."}], "answer": "1110.18"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "Future value = $10,000, time = 12 years."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Annual rate = 3.5%, so growth factor = 1.035."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Present value = 10000 / (1.035)^12."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "(1.035)^12 \u2248 1.511068, so present value \u2248 10000 / 1.511068 = 6614.78."}], "answer": "6614.78"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "Principal = $1,200."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Continuous rate = 10% = 0.10, time = 4 years."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Balance = 1200 \u00d7 e^(0.10 \u00d7 4) = 1200 \u00d7 e^0.4."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "e^0.4 \u2248 1.49182, so balance \u2248 1200 \u00d7 1.49182 = 1790.184."}], "answer": "1790.18"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "Principal = $6,000, target = $12,000."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Quarterly rate = 0.05/4 = 0.0125."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Need 6000 \u00d7 (1.0125)^(4n) = 12000 \u2192 (1.0125)^(4n) = 2."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "4n = ln(2)/ln(1.0125) \u2248 0.6931/0.012422 \u2248 55.8, so n \u2248 13.95 years \u2192 full years = 14."}], "answer": "14"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "Principal = $900."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Monthly rate = 0.025/12 = 0.00208333, number of months = 6\u00d712 = 72."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Balance = 900 \u00d7 (1 + 0.00208333)^72."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "(1.00208333)^72 \u2248 1.16147, so balance \u2248 900 \u00d7 1.16147 = 1045.323."}], "answer": "1045.32"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "The sum of two numbers is 20."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Their difference is 4."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Let the numbers be x and y, with x + y = 20 and x \u2212 y = 4."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "Adding the two equations gives 2x = 24, so x = 12."}], "answer": "12"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "An adult ticket costs $3 more than a child ticket."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Two adult tickets and three child tickets cost $36."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Let a = adult price and c = child price, then a = c + 3 and 2a + 3c = 36."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "Substitute a = c + 3 into 2(c + 3) + 3c = 36 \u2192 2c + 6 + 3c = 36 \u2192 5c = 30 \u2192 c = 6."}], "answer": "6"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "The perimeter of a rectangle is 30 cm."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "The length is twice the width."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Let width = w and length = 2w, then perimeter = 2(2w + w) = 6w = 30."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "6w = 30 \u2192 w = 5."}], "answer": "5"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "Three apples and two oranges cost $7."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Two apples and three oranges cost $6."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Let a = apple price, o = orange price, then 3a + 2o = 7 and 2a + 3o = 6."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "Multiply first by 3 \u2192 9a + 6o = 21; multiply second by 2 \u2192 4a + 6o = 12; subtract: 5a = 9 \u2192 a = 1.8."}], "answer": "1.8"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "Travels 20 km downstream in 2 hours."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Travels 20 km upstream in 5 hours."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Downstream speed = 20/2 = 10 km/h, upstream speed = 20/5 = 4 km/h."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "Let b = boat speed, c = current, then b + c = 10 and b \u2212 c = 4; adding: 2b = 14 \u2192 b = 7."}], "answer": "7"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "The sum of their ages is 50."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "The father is 4 times as old as the son."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Let son = s and father = 4s, then s + 4s = 50."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "5s = 50 \u2192 s = 10."}], "answer": "10"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "There are 20 people total."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Total admission cost is $100, adults $8, children $4."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Let a = adults, c = children, then a + c = 20 and 8a + 4c = 100."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "From first, a = 20 \u2212 c; substitute into second: 8(20 \u2212 c) + 4c = 100 \u2192 160 \u2212 8c + 4c = 100 \u2192 \u22124c = \u221260 \u2192 c = 15."}], "answer": "15"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "The sum of two numbers is 15."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "The product of the two numbers is 56."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Let numbers be x and y, so x + y = 15 and xy = 56."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "Solve: from x + y = 15, y = 15 \u2212 x; then x(15 \u2212 x) = 56 \u2192 x\u00b2 \u2212 15x + 56 = 0 \u2192 (x \u2212 7)(x \u2212 8) = 0 \u2192 x = 7 or 8; smaller is 7."}], "answer": "7"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "First 10 students have average 70."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Remaining 10 students have average 90."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Total score of first 10 = 10 \u00d7 70 = 700."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3, 2], "text": "Total score of remaining 10 = 10 \u00d7 90 = 900, so overall total = 700 + 900 = 1600."}, {"id": 5, "deps": [4], "text": "Overall average = 1600 \u00f7 20 = 80."}], "answer": "80"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "Homework score is 80, weight 20%."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Quiz score is 90, weight 30%."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [], "text": "Final exam score is 75, weight 50%."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [1, 2, 3], "text": "Weighted sum = 80\u00d70.20 + 90\u00d70.30 + 75\u00d70.50 = 16 + 27 + 37.5 = 80.5."}, {"id": 5, "deps": [4], "text": "Weights sum to 1.0, so weighted average = 80.5."}], "answer": "80.5"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "Sand: 3 kg at $2 per kg."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Gravel: 2 kg at $5 per kg."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Total cost of sand = 3\u00d72 = $6."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3, 2], "text": "Total cost of gravel = 2\u00d75 = $10, so total cost = $16, total weight = 5 kg."}, {"id": 5, "deps": [4], "text": "Average cost per kg = 16 \u00f7 5 = 3.2."}], "answer": "3.2"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "First segment: 10 km at 8 km/h."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Second segment: 5 km at 12 km/h."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1], "text": "Time for first segment = 10 \u00f7 8 = 1.25 hours."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [2], "text": "Time for second segment = 5 \u00f7 12 = 0.4167 hours."}, {"id": 5, "deps": [3, 4], "text": "Total distance = 15 km, total time = 1.25 + 0.4167 = 1.6667 hours."}, {"id": 6, "deps": [5], "text": "Average speed = 15 \u00f7 1.6667 = 9."}], "answer": "9"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "5 employees earn $40,000 each."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "3 employees earn $60,000 each."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1], "text": "Total salary for first group = 5 \u00d7 40,000 = 200,000."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [2], "text": "Total salary for second group = 3 \u00d7 60,000 = 180,000."}, {"id": 5, "deps": [3, 4], "text": "Total salary = 380,000, total employees = 8."}, {"id": 6, "deps": [5], "text": "Average salary = 380,000 \u00f7 8 = 47,500."}], "answer": "47500"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "Part A weight 40%, score 60."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "Part B weight 60%, score 80."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1, 2], "text": "Weighted contribution = 60\u00d70.40 + 80\u00d70.60 = 24 + 48 = 72."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [3], "text": "Weights sum to 1, so overall average = 72."}], "answer": "72"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "100 shares at $50 each."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "200 shares at $40 each."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1], "text": "Cost of first lot = 100 \u00d7 50 = 5000."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [2], "text": "Cost of second lot = 200 \u00d7 40 = 8000."}, {"id": 5, "deps": [3, 4], "text": "Total cost = 13000, total shares = 300."}, {"id": 6, "deps": [5], "text": "Average price = 13000 \u00f7 300 = 43.333\u2026, which rounds to 43.33."}], "answer": "43.33"}
{"steps": [{"id": 1, "deps": [], "text": "5 shots score 2 points each."}, {"id": 2, "deps": [], "text": "10 free throws score 1 point each."}, {"id": 3, "deps": [1], "text": "Points from shots = 5 \u00d7 2 = 10."}, {"id": 4, "deps": [2], "text": "Points from free throws = 10 \u00d7 1 = 10."}, {"id": 5, "deps": [3, 4], "text": "Total points = 20, total shots = 15."}, {"id": 6, "deps": [5], "text": "Average points per shot = 20 \u00f7 15 = 1.333\u2026, which is 4/3."}], "answer": "1.33"}
